.TH "ARC-COMPLETION" "1" "2026-09-27" "arc-cli" "Arc Manual"
.SH "NAME"
arc\-completion \- manage shell completion
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
arc completion ACTION [LOCATION]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Generate Zsh completion and inspect, refresh, or clear Arc's remote completion cache.
.SH "OPTIONS"
arc completion zsh
.PP
arc completion cache [\-\-json]
.PP
arc completion refresh LOCATION
.PP
arc completion clear\-cache [LOCATION] [\-\-json]
.SH "SEMANTICS"
The generated Zsh completion registers all installed executable aliases and resolves them to canonical Arc commands before asking the hidden completion protocol for candidates.
.SH "EXAMPLES"
arc completion zsh > completions/_arc
.PP
arc completion cache \-\-json
.SH "SEE ALSO"
arc(1), arc\-formats(7), arc\-backends(7), arc\-remote(7)
